# Data-Driven Stock Analysis Project

This project analyzes Nifty 50 stocks, cleans the data, and builds dashboards in Streamlit and Power BI.

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- SQL
- Streamlit
- Power BI

## Project Workflow
1. Data Extraction (YAML → CSV)
2. Data Cleaning
3. Data Analysis
4. Visualization
5. Dashboard (Streamlit + Power BI)
